  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'ESCAPE THE WYRM

    Drive the same seeded kingdom escape as your rivals.
    Follow your route to the announced refuge: fully inside the fortress, inside
    the mountain chamber, or onto the evacuation boat. Stop upright within the inner
    zone to secure your truck. For the boat, drive up the ramp, settle your wheels
    on its deck, and wait for the announced departure.


    Dragons follow visible
    or audible evidence. Horns and fast driving carry farther; take cover and change
    routes. Warned structures can collapse into real debris. Your GPS preserves a
    usable detour for every surviving crew. If overturned or stuck, stop and press
    ACTION for a physical self-righting attempt. Two attempts are available; each
    adds six seconds to your recorded escape time. Damage remains. Wrecked or unrecoverable
    crews enter spectator view.


    Competitive crews receive placements for genuine
    extraction; same-step ties share a place. Cooperative Convoy wins when every
    crew extracts. The deadline closes the rescue window. Choose chase, cab or shared
    broadcast; optional AI views change camera space.'
